"kriggt."

#: windows.cpp:247
msgid "S&eparate screen focus"
msgstr "Fokus na Schirm scheden"

#: windows.cpp:249
msgid ""
"When this option is enabled, focus operations are limited only to the active "
"Xinerama screen"
msgstr ""
"Is dit anmaakt, speelt sik Fokus-Akschonen bloots op den aktiven Xinerama-"
"Schirm af."

#: windows.cpp:252
msgid "Active screen follows &mouse"
msgstr "&Muus treckt anmaakt Schirm na"

#: windows.cpp:254
msgid ""
"When this option is enabled, the active Xinerama screen (where new windows "
"appear, for example) is the screen containing the mouse pointer. When "
"disabled, the active Xinerama screen is the  screen containing the focused "
"window. By default this option is disabled for Click to focus and enabled "
"for other focus policies."
msgstr ""
"Is dit anmaakt, is de aktive Xinerama-Schirm (op den t.B. niege Finstern "
"opdukt) de Schirm mit den Muuswieser. Is dit utmaakt, is dat de Schirm mit "
"dat opstunns aktive Finster. Disse Optschoon is bi de Fokusregel \"Klick "
"maakt aktiv\" standardwies ut- un bi anner Fokusregeln anmaakt."

